{"sourceUrl":"https://hjzy.xtu.edu.cn/info/1003/7325.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:07.483465+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://hjzy.xtu.edu.cn/info/1003/7325.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>湘潭大学座落在毛泽东同志的故乡、中国历史文化名城</span><span>——</span><span>湖南湘潭，是全国首批招收环境工程专业的高校之一。</span></span><span><span>2022</span><span>年</span><span>2</span><span>月，学校入选国家“双一流”建设高校。湖南省人民政府与教育部共建高校、湖南省人民政府与国家国防科技工业局共建高校。湘潭大学是全国最早设立环境科学与工程学科的高校之一。</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hjzy.xtu.edu.cn/__local/D/65/69/50F23C532BA5617BB3747A6A4EC_7931412C_6B170.png\"/></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湘潭大学环境与资源学</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>于</span><span>1</span></span><span>97</span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>年筹建</span></span><span><span>环境学科，</span><span>1</span></span><span>977</span><span><span>年招收环境工程专业本科生，</span><span>1</span></span><span>994</span><span><span>年招收硕士研究生</span></span><span><span>。现有</span></span><span><span>拥有</span></span><span><span>环境科学与工程一级学科博士授权点、</span></span><span><span>环境科学与工程一级学科硕士授权点、资源与环境硕士专业学位授权点和博士后流动站，形成了完整的本科</span>-<span>硕士</span><span>-</span><span>博士</span><span>-</span><span>博士后的人才培养体</span></span><span><span>系。</span></span><span><span>环境</span><span>/</span><span>生态学科于</span><span>2024</span><span>年进入</span><span>ESI</span><span>全球</span><span>1%</span><span>。</span></span><span><span>在环境科学、环境工程、资源低碳循环利用、环境生态健康、安全工程等学科方向</span></span><span><span>招收培养研究生。</span></span><span><span>目前拥有</span><span>“复杂重金属废水高效净化技术与应用”湖南省工程实验室、“铅锂电池高效循环利用”湖南省工程技术研究中心、“环境友好与资源高效利用化工新技术”</span></span><span><span>、</span><span>“环境生态健康”湖南省普通高等学校重点实验室、“新污染物的环境行为与控制原理”湖南省普通高校科研创新平台、</span></span><span><span>湖</span></span><span><span>南省协同创新中心等多个国家级和省部级科研平台。</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hjzy.xtu.edu.cn/__local/3/9A/BB/AD29A7003912C89DEC5E753C2C7_5318DB82_AEC13.png\"/></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为了促进高校优秀大学生之间的学术交流，激发青年学生的学习热情和研究兴趣，帮助广大青年学子深入了解湘潭大学及环境与资源学院，选拔优秀本科学生进入我校继续深造，湘潭大学环境与资源学院</span></span><span><span>定于</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>至</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日举办</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>环境菁英，绿色未来</span><span>”</span><span>夏令营，欢迎有意报考湘潭大学环境科学与工程、资源与环境专业研究生的优秀学子踊跃报名参加。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、活动安排</span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、活动时间</span></span><span><span>：</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span>-7<span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日（</span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日报到）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、拟招收人数：</span></span><span>30<span>人</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、活动</span></span><span><span>地点</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>湘潭大学</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4<span>、日程安排：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日下午</span></span><span><span>15:00-17:00</span></span><span><span>：营员报到</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日上午</span></span><span><span>9:00-12:00</span></span><span><span>：开营仪式、专题报告</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日下午</span><span>2:30-5:00</span><span>：本院校史文化讲解、</span></span><span><span>营员与导师交流</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>上</span></span><span><span>午</span></span><span><span>8:30-14:00</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>企业</span></span><span><span>参观学习、</span></span><span><span>伟人故里韶山</span></span><span><span>参观学习</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>12</span><span>日下午</span><span>16:00</span></span><span><span>闭营仪式</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、全国</span></span><span><span>各</span></span><span><span>高校相关专业</span>202</span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>级（</span>202</span><span><span>7</span><span>届</span></span><span><span>毕业</span></span><span><span>生</span></span><span><span>）的在校大学生，环境类、化学化工类、生物类、材料类等相关专业均可报名。（本届夏令营活动涉及硕士研究生招生专业：环境科学与工程、资源与环境。）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、专业学习成绩优秀。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的科研能力和创新能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>、诚实守信，身心健康，学风端正，未受过任何处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、申请程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请流程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>系统注册填报</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请登录湘潭大学研究生报考服务系统（网址：</span> <span>https://yzbm.xtu.edu.cn/logout</span><span>），招生项目为“全国优秀大学生夏令营”，注册获取报名号，用报名号重新登录，查看相关规定，填写报名信息，上传报名材料，核查无误后保存、提交；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名材料（提交电子档或扫描件）包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）报名系统生成的夏令营申请表（报名系统上传材料步骤下载后，所在院系签字盖章后再扫描）；。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）目前的本科阶段最新成绩单</span><span>1</span><span>份以及本科成绩排名证明</span><span>1</span><span>份（院系盖章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）身份证和学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>各类获奖证书、学术或科研成果扫描件</span></span><span><span>等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>在系统中提交的报名材料请按上述顺序扫描拼接到一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档中（命名方式：姓名</span><span>-</span><span>报名号），并将该</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档压缩后上传，材料力求精简，图文清晰即可。</span></span><span><span>申请材料提交截止时间</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span>23:59</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>入营资格审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院会组织学科专家认真审阅提交的申请材料，择优确定入营名单，预计于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span>日</span><span>17:00</span><span>前通过短信或电话方式通知夏令营入营者（届时未接到入营通知的学生，不再另行通知）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学生确认</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>入选营员于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>17:00</span><span>点前在报名网页首页“审核状态查询”中确认参加与否，逾期不确认参营者视为自动放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、学员待遇</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、食宿：我校将为入选营员提供夏令营期间在校的食宿。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、交通费：外地高校学生请自行预定往返车票，我校将资助外地学生往返湘潭的火车硬座票或汽车票费用，学生须提供本人往返车票票据。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、保险：我校将为入选营员统一购买在湘潭大学活动期间的团体意外保险，建议各位营员自购旅途意外保险。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、其他</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、若发现申请材料有虚假成分，即取消申请人一切由此获得的权益，并保留相关追溯权；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、开营后要求全程参加夏令营活动，按时参加活动</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、联 系 人：</span></span><span><span>罗</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系方式：</span>0731-58292330</span></p>\n<p><span>QQ<span>交流群：</span></span><span><span>688244198</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hjzy.xtu.edu.cn/__local/7/54/61/24F3DB78004D769FE39C2A78BD6_71961EB3_511EF.png\"/></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湘潭大学研究生院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湘潭大学环境与资源学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>20</span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span>6<span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"c95fd242d47b4c0b59fed36cbef114b9629b9a1fb0f89a3bf1f19b601d2e1309","textLength":1857,"sourceSha256":"1b85626d0a00565287a4308e9056f717de0c19923e7b38988da1364e377093c8","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-84e8452790cf438dd426","title":"2026年湘潭大学环境与资源学院第八届“环境菁英，绿色未来”优秀大学生夏令营招生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:07.483465+00:00"}
